ts a text-based knowledge graph using established text-centric extraction pipelines. These complementary graphs are merged through entity alignment. This design ensures accurate cross-modal grounding and comprehensive coverage of textual semantics, enabling richer knowledge representation and robust retrieval.\nImage Path: /Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/parsed/rag-anything-handson-v1/mineru/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025_4ae5f35e/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025/auto/images/d960511e87edf887a6ee67caba7d4f7cb9da80f3fe7cdea264ab856390831d14.jpg
